+For a new local build of the documented Arena runtime, pass its exact local
+image ID with `--arena-image-id sha256:...`. Tags are not accepted. The launcher
+checks the ID before launch and records the selected image in `run.json`;
+this identifies the deployment without transferring validation from a previous
+machine or image. Omitting the option preserves the original image binding.
+
 The native workspace includes an optional [basic policy library](../../basic-skills/README.md).
